  "worked_solution": "Using the formula for the distance, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{d}(x,y) & =\u2016x-y\u2016 \\\\  & =\\sqrt{({x}_{1}-{y}_{1})^{2}+({x}_{2}-{y}_{2})^{2}+({x}_{3}-{y}_{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(1-4)^{2}+(3-(-2))^{2}+(-2-3)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{(-3)^{2}+{5}^{2}+(-5)^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+25+25} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{59}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
